22:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","p","CapCut is a free video editor fr",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"CapCut is a free video editor from Bytedance, the company behind TikTok, built so complete beginners can produce polished videos without editing experience. Its signature feature is templates: pick a trending template, drop in your own clips, and the cuts, effects, and beat sync are done for you in seconds."}],["$","p","In Indonesia, CapCut is the defa",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"In Indonesia, CapCut is the default tool for TikTok creators, online sellers, teachers, and small-business social media admins. It runs on Android and iOS, with desktop and web versions for longer projects. This page sticks to the verified facts and links only to the official Play Store listing."}]]}]
23:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":["What ","CapCut"," Does"]}],[["$","p","The everyday toolkit covers trim",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"The everyday toolkit covers trimming, splitting, speed curves, stabilization, filters, transitions, background removal, and chroma key. Its automatic captions turn speech into editable subtitles — including Indonesian — which saves creators the slowest part of short-video production. A large music and sound-effect library is built in, and audio can also be extracted from videos in your gallery."}],["$","p","Most of that is free. CapCut Pro",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Most of that is free. CapCut Pro is an optional paid subscription that unlocks extra effects, transitions, stock assets, AI features, and more cloud space; the official price is whatever the Play Store shows when you subscribe. Projects can start on a phone and continue on a computer, which suits sellers producing content on a weekly rhythm."}]]]}]
24:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Safety & Privacy"}],[["$","p","The official CapCut is signed by",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"The official CapCut is signed by Bytedance Pte. Ltd. and is safe to use. The most common trap aimed at its users is the 'CapCut Pro mod' — APK files from random sites promising every paid feature unlocked free. A mod means unknown parties rewrote the app's code, and you have no way to verify nothing was added; your projects and account carry the risk."}],["$","p","There is no legal way to get Cap",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"There is no legal way to get CapCut Pro permanently free, so treat any such promise as a warning sign. On privacy, features that send your footage to cloud or AI processing are governed by CapCut's privacy policy; for sensitive material, prefer tools that work locally on the device. Update only from the Play Store, never from links forwarded in chat groups."}]]]}]
25:["$","section",null,{"className":"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-mist p-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-bold text-ink","children":"Good for"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":[["$","li","Beginners editing their first TikTok or Reel",{"children":"Beginners editing their first TikTok or Reel"}],["$","li","Sellers making product videos on a phone",{"children":"Sellers making product videos on a phone"}],["$","li","Teachers adding Indonesian captions to lessons",{"children":"Teachers adding Indonesian captions to lessons"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-mist p-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-bold text-ink","children":"Watch out for"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":[["$","li","'Pro unlocked' mods that carry malware",{"children":"'Pro unlocked' mods that carry malware"}],["$","li","Heavy exports draining small-RAM phones",{"children":"Heavy exports draining small-RAM phones"}],["$","li","Best effects gradually moving behind Pro",{"children":"Best effects gradually moving behind Pro"}]]}]]}]]}]
26:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"divide-y divide-mist rounded-2xl border border-mist","children":[["$","details","Is CapCut really free?",{"className":"group p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink","children":"Is CapCut really free?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink/75","children":"Yes for its core toolkit, which is what most creators use daily. A Pro subscription adds premium effects, transitions, stock, and AI extras. The official price is the one shown in the Play Store — ignore any site promising Pro free forever."}]]}],["$","details","How do I remove the CapCut watermark?",{"className":"group p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink","children":"How do I remove the CapCut watermark?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink/75","children":"For videos you edit yourself, export without a template and check the ending-watermark setting; the mark usually comes from a template's closing clip, which you can delete in the timeline. You do not need a modified app for this."}]]}],["$","details","Does CapCut work offline?",{"className":"group p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink","children":"Does CapCut work offline?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink/75","children":"Basic editing of files already on your phone works offline. Downloading templates, music, and effects, and using cloud or AI features, needs an internet connection — grab the assets you need while on Wi-Fi if your data plan is tight."}]]}]]}]]}]
